      "source": "Retrieve a <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> by inspecting <code>ConnectionFactory</code> and its metadata.",
      "translation": "通过检查 <code>ConnectionFactory</code> 及其元数据来获取一个 <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>。",
