      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolves a <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> from a <code>ConnectionFactory</code> using <a href=\"DialectResolver.R2dbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver.R2dbcDialectProvider</code></a>. Dialect\nresolution uses Spring's <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>spring.factories</code></a> to determine available extensions.",
      "translation": "从 <code>ConnectionFactory</code> 中解析出 <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>，使用 <a href=\"DialectResolver.R2dbcDialectProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver.R2dbcDialectProvider</code></a>。方言解析利用 Spring 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/io/support/SpringFactoriesLoader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.io.support\"><code>spring.factories</code></a> 来确定可用的扩展。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Exception thrown when <a href=\"DialectResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver</code></a> cannot resolve a <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>.",
      "translation": "抛出异常，因为<a href=\"DialectResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver</code></a>无法解析一个<a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "SPI to extend Spring's default R2DBC Dialect discovery mechanism.",
      "translation": "SPI 将扩展 Spring 默认的 R2DBC 方言发现机制。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the resolved <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> <a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver.NoDialectException</code></a> if the database type cannot be determined from\n        <code>ConnectionFactory</code>.",
      "translation": "抛出已解决的<a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a><a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>DialectResolver.NoDialectException</code></a>异常，如果无法从<code>ConnectionFactory</code>确定数据库类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\">DialectResolver.NoDialectException</a></code> - if no <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a> can be found.",
      "translation": "<code><a href=\"DialectResolver.NoDialectException.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\">DialectResolver.NoDialectException</a></code> - 如果找不到任何 <a href=\"R2dbcDialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.r2dbc.dialect\"><code>R2dbcDialect</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
